y for fun, but has no idea what he’s getting himself into. He suddenly starts acting strange, but Mikaru has no idea what’s wrong or that Cipher is behind it. What exactly is Cipher? What sort of secrets does it hold? Apollo and Mikaru will unravel a mystery encompassing the past, present, and future to find out.\n\n(Source: Nippon Cinema)"},"tags":[{"name":"Fugitive","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rotoscoping","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Baton","english":null,"native":"バトン","romaji":"Baton","synonyms":[]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}